<title>JAPAN: Nippon Steel plans capex of 100 bln yen in 1997/98.</title>
<headline>Nippon Steel plans capex of 100 bln yen in 1997/98.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Steel Corp said on Thursday it plans capital spending of around 100 billion yen for the year from April 1.</p>
<p>The company said earlier it estimated total capital spending for the current year would be 95 billion yen.</p>
<p>A company official said parent sales for 1997/98 were expected to rise slightly from an estimated 2.17 trillion yen in the current year, but did not give an actual figure.</p>
</text>
